<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">LIVE CAMPUS / SHARED BY YOU</view><view class="title">看看人多不多</view><view class="subtitle">每一次上报，帮下一位同学少等一会儿。</view><view class="panel stats"><view><text>{{coverage}}/{{totalWindows}}</text>有近期数据的窗口</view><view><text>{{activeReports}}</text>近期上报条数</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="plan">🗓 就餐日历与周预算</button><view class="notice">统计最近15分钟，每位食客取最新上报。等待时间为粗略参考。同一地点每分钟可上报一次，每天最多20次，前5次各加2分。</view><view class="row"><text class="muted">30秒刷新 · {{updated}}</text><button class="small" bindtap="refresh">立即刷新</button></view><view class="panel" wx:for="{{canteens}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">{{item.emoji}} {{item.name}}</view><text class="status l{{item.crowd.level}}">{{item.crowd.label}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.crowd.count}} 位有效上报 · {{item.crowd.eta}}<view></view>{{item.crowd.freshness}} · {{item.crowd.sampleHint}}</view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="small" data-type="canteen" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-level="1" bindtap="report" disabled="{{item.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">🟢 较空闲</button><button class="small" data-type="canteen" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-level="2" bindtap="report" disabled="{{item.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">🟡 需等待</button><button class="small" data-type="canteen" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-level="3" bindtap="report" disabled="{{item.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">🔴 较拥挤</button></view><view class="muted mt">{{item.allowance.hint}}</view><view class="record" wx:for="{{item.windows}}" wx:for-item="w" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view>{{w.name}}</view><text class="status l{{w.crowd.level}}">{{w.crowd.label}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{w.crowd.freshness}} · {{w.crowd.sampleHint}}<view></view>{{w.crowd.eta}} · {{w.allowance.hint}}</view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="small" data-type="window" data-id="{{w.id}}" data-level="1" bindtap="report" disabled="{{w.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">空闲</button><button class="small" data-type="window" data-id="{{w.id}}" data-level="2" bindtap="report" disabled="{{w.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">等待</button><button class="small" data-type="window" data-id="{{w.id}}" data-level="3" bindtap="report" disabled="{{w.allowance.blocked||reporting}}">拥挤</button></view></view></view><view class="owner">模块负责人 · 范星宇</view></view>
